{"updateDataModel":{"surfaceId":"issue","path":"/issue","value":{"key":"EV-1284","author":"Danny","title":"Charging session stalls at 80% on DC fast chargers","status":"In progress","priority":"High","label":"Charging","description":"When starting a session on **DC fast chargers** (tested on Ionity and Smatrics), the session stalls at ~80% and never resumes.

**Steps to reproduce**
1. Start a DC session from the app
2. Wait until SoC reaches 80%
3. Observe power drop to 0 kW while the session stays active

**Expected:** charging tapers and continues to the configured limit.","comments":[{"id":"c1","author":"Lena Hofer","createdAt":"2026-10-22T09:14:00Z","body":"Reproduced on firmware 4.2.1. Logs show the charger sending a pause request we never acknowledge."},{"id":"c2","author":"Marco Steiner","createdAt":"2026-10-22T15:40:00Z","body":"Looks related to the OCPP 1.6 SetChargingProfile handling we changed last sprint. I'll put a fix up for review."},{"id":"c3","author":"Danny","createdAt":"2026-10-23T08:05:00Z","body":"Thanks both — let's target the 4.2.2 hotfix."}]}}}
